# ZvenFit Estetika — core rules

Static Webflow landing (cosmetology). Source: `public/`, `scripts/`, `functions/`. **Never edit `dist/`.**

After changes: `npm run build` or `npm run dev:watch`.

## APIs (injected at build)

- Lead + newsletter: `functions/telegram-lead/` → `window.ZVENFIT_LEAD_API`

## CDN vs site bucket

- HTML references CDN: `https://storage.yandexcloud.net/zvenfit-estetika/...`
- CI deploys lean `dist/` to `zvenfit-estetika-frontend` bucket
- Mutable CDN assets: manual `npm run upload:assets` (vendor CSS and webflow.js only)
- Images and fonts: managed directly in CDN; `upload:assets` must never touch them

## Build

`scripts/build-static.cjs` injects Metrika, UTM, OG, JSON-LD at `</head>`.
SEO config: `scripts/structured-data.config.json`.

## Raw Webflow

Save exports to `upload/` (gitignored). Port markup to `public/`.

## Secrets

No tokens in HTML/JS. Env / GitHub Secrets only.

## Verify

`npm run lint:public` and `npm run test:build`. Full guide: `AGENTS.md`.

## Deploy

**Site bucket:** via GitHub Actions only — do not manually sync unless user asks.

**CDN bucket:** manual `upload:assets` for vendor CSS/webflow.js. Images and fonts are excluded from sync; legal HTML ships with the site.
